    {
      "id": "u_6d5503f3b31c9afaa47a0de5_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "PDFs can also be shared using the __TRILIUM_PH_0__Sharing__TRILIUM_PH_1__ feature. This will also use Trilium's customized PDF viewer.",
      "sourceHash": "6d5503f3b31c9afaa47a0de5e71bd5e2001a225b02e91aea0e1619537392a066",
      "context": "PDFs > Share functionality",
      "contextHash": "5e2b9288a5177c717f7d840dd7ffa02cbcc54fd1da8511e7197c8c2f5ef88fe8",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_5603e7c93e6821eb7762aed7_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "If you are using a reverse proxy on your server with strict access limitations for the share functionality, make sure that __TRILIUM_PH_0__ directory is accessible. Note that this directory is outside the __TRILIUM_PH_1__ route as it's common with the rest of the application.",
      "sourceHash": "5603e7c93e6821eb7762aed7ba5559b9d5e1583ee5acac33309691e92ce40086",
      "context": "PDFs > Share functionality",
      "contextHash": "5e2b9288a5177c717f7d840dd7ffa02cbcc54fd1da8511e7197c8c2f5ef88fe8",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
